<template><div class="ledger-page"><section class="card-compact"><h2>审批接入与提醒配置</h2><p>由管理员核验企业应用、财务模板及字段。凭证从服务器配置读取，此页不回显密钥。当前支持按审批编号主动读取；自动定时同步尚未启用。</p><p>钉钉凭证：{{status.dingtalk_configured?'已配置（范围待实测）':'未配置'}} · 企微审批：{{status.wecom_configured?'已配置（范围待实测）':'未配置'}} · 工资条企微提醒：{{status.wecom_reminder_configured?'已配置（送达待实测）':'未配置'}}</p><p role="alert" class="ledger-error">{{error||status.config_error}}</p><el-button @click="load">刷新状态</el-button></section><section class="card-compact"><h3>读取指定原审批单</h3><el-form class="ledger-form" label-position="top"><el-form-item label="已配置财务模板"><el-select v-model="form.template_key"><el-option v-for="t in status.templates" :key="t.key" :value="t.key" :label="t.platform+' · '+t.entity+' · '+t.key"/></el-select></el-form-item><el-form-item label="原审批编号"><el-input v-model="form.source_no" maxlength="120"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="申请人内部账号编号（需核验身份）"><el-input v-model="form.requester_id"/></el-form-item></el-form><el-checkbox v-model="form.historical">历史付款状态需核实</el-checkbox><p>导入后仍由财务核验申请人与收款字段。已登记单再次读取后会暂缓，防止源审批变更导致误付款。</p><el-button type="primary" @click="dialog=true">核对并读取</el-button><p>{{message}}</p></section><section class="card-compact"><h3>最近同步结果</h3><el-table :data="status.runs"><el-table-column prop="created_at" label="时间" min-width="190"/><el-table-column prop="platform" label="平台"/><el-table-column prop="source_no" label="审批编号"/><el-table-column prop="status" label="结果"/><el-table-column prop="message" label="说明" min-width="250"/></el-table></section><NotificationDialog v-model="dialog" title="确认读取原审批单"><p>将读取所选审批单并建立或更新内部付款台账，不发起审批或付款。请确认申请人账号及历史付款范围正确。</p><p class="ledger-error">{{dialogError}}</p><template #footer><el-button :disabled="busy" @click="dialog=false">取消</el-button><el-button type="primary" :loading="busy" @click="run">确认读取并登记</el-button></template></NotificationDialog></div></template>
<script setup>
import {onMounted,ref} from 'vue'
import {businessLedgerApi as api} from '@/api'
import NotificationDialog from '@/components/NotificationDialog.vue'
import '@/styles/business-ledger.css'
const status=ref({templates:[],runs:[]}),form=ref({template_key:'',source_no:'',requester_id:'',historical:true}),error=ref(''),message=ref(''),dialog=ref(false),dialogError=ref(''),busy=ref(false)
async function load(){try{status.value=await api.integrations();error.value=''}catch(e){error.value=e.message}}
async function run(){busy.value=true;dialogError.value='';try{const r=await api.importApproval({...form.value,requester_id:Number(form.value.requester_id),confirm:true});message.value=r.message;dialog.value=false;await load()}catch(e){dialogError.value=e.message}finally{busy.value=false}}onMounted(load)
</script>
